---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout
  title="How We Research Buying Guides | SmartPickHub"
  description="Learn how SmartPickHub researches product specifications, compares regional models, explains trade-offs and handles affiliate links."
>
  <article class="buying-guide">
    <header class="guide-header">
      <h1>How We Research Buying Guides</h1>
      <p class="guide-summary">SmartPickHub creates research-led buying guides to help shoppers understand product differences, regional variants and the trade-offs that matter before they buy.</p>
    </header>

    <section aria-labelledby="sources-title">
      <h2 id="sources-title">Sources and product information</h2>
      <p>We use product information from manufacturer product pages, technical specifications, manuals and support documentation wherever available. Retailer pages may be used to corroborate a regional model number, retail part number or package detail; a retailer listing is not presented as a manufacturer specification source.</p>
      <p>When a model has different US and UK names, specifications or packages, we identify those differences where the available evidence supports them. If regional equivalence or availability is uncertain, we say so rather than treating two model names as identical.</p>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="comparisons-title">
      <h2 id="comparisons-title">How we compare products</h2>
      <p>We focus on the features that affect a buying decision in each category, such as compatibility, capacity, connectivity, performance limits, maintenance, consumables, subscriptions, warranty and total ownership considerations.</p>
      <p>Our guides explain who a product may suit, its potential advantages and the points buyers should check. A comparison is not automatically a laboratory test, a universal ranking or a claim that one model is best for every household.</p>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="regional-title">
      <h2 id="regional-title">UK and US model differences</h2>
      <p>Products sold under similar names can have different model identifiers, voltage, plugs, radio configurations, accessories, software features, consumables and warranty terms. Check the exact model and regional package before ordering. Never assume a US electrical model is suitable for UK mains or vice versa.</p>
      <p>Where both marketplaces are provided, the Amazon UK and Amazon US links are separate. Some links open marketplace search results for a model phrase rather than a verified direct product listing. Confirm the exact model, seller, delivery terms and return policy on the retailer page.</p>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="prices-title">
      <h2 id="prices-title">Prices, availability and reviews</h2>
      <p>Retail prices, stock, delivery options, review counts and ratings can change. We do not treat an old or unverified value as a current price or availability claim. Check the live retailer listing before purchase. Manufacturer specifications are attributed to their source and are not represented as independent performance measurements.</p>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="testing-title">
      <h2 id="testing-title">Testing, limitations and updates</h2>
      <p>Unless a guide explicitly states otherwise, our product summaries are based on documentary research and editorial analysis, not physical hands-on testing. We do not claim to have personally tested a product when we have not.</p>
      <p>We update a guide when its content has been substantively reviewed. An update date should reflect a real review or material change, not be advanced simply to make a page appear fresh.</p>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="affiliate-title">
      <h2 id="affiliate-title">Affiliate links and disclosure</h2>
      <p>Some links are affiliate links and are identified near the relevant links as paid links. SmartPickHub may earn a commission from qualifying purchases at no additional cost to the shopper. Affiliate relationships do not replace the need to check the product's specifications, regional compatibility and current retailer terms.</p>
      <p><strong>As an Amazon Associate I earn from qualifying purchases.</strong> Read our full <a href="/affiliate-disclosure/">Affiliate Disclosure</a>.</p>
    </section>

    <p><a href="/guides/">Explore all SmartPickHub buying guides</a>.</p>
  </article>
</Layout>
